# The "remote" catalog service that the clients of module 04 call. It is simulated inside the lesson app.
# Start the lesson first: ./mvnw -pl modules/04-http-clients-resilience/lesson -am spring-boot:run

### A book
GET http://localhost:8080/catalog/books/9780134685991

### Unknown book → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/catalog/books/9780000000000

### Price — fails with 503 twice per ISBN, then answers (the retry demo)
GET http://localhost:8080/catalog/books/9781617297571/price

### Cover — takes 200 ms (the concurrency-limit demo)
GET http://localhost:8080/catalog/books/9780134685991/cover
